Final angular speed, $\omega_f=0$
From first equation of motion,

\begin{array}{rlrl}
\omega_f & =\omega_i+\alpha t \\
\Rightarrow & \frac{\omega_f-\omega_i}{t} & =\alpha \Rightarrow \alpha=\frac{0-16 \pi}{8} \\
\therefore & \alpha & =-2 \pi \mathrm{rad} \mathrm{s}^{-2}
\end{array}

Therefore, magnitude of angular acceleration,

|\alpha|=2 \pi \mathrm{rads}^{-2}

